{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And they embittered their lives.</b> As they continued to add sin in beliefs and in deeds — as the prophet testified, saying (Ezekiel 20:8): וַיַּמְרוּ בִי וְלֹא אָבוּ לִשְׁמֹעַ אֵלַי, אִישׁ שִׁקּוּצֵי עֵינֵיהֶם לֹא הִשְׁלִיכוּ, וְאֶת גִּלּוּלֵי מִצְרַיִם לֹא עָזָבוּ, וָאֹמַר לִשְׁפֹּךְ חֲמָתִי עֲלֵיהֶם, לְכַלּוֹת אַפִּי בָּהֶם בְּתוֹךְ אֶרֶץ מִצְרָיִם — so too the hand of their adversaries was upon them, growing ever harsher."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:56.180645797Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}